From 6a079e116697e841cd8dff2e917bd19c3a4970b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: omp-agents <omp-agents@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 11:57:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(coding-agent): tighten runtime tool contracts for xd
 devices and seance

List MCP devices per server, accept read selectors on xd:// docs while
rejecting them on device writes, hint instead of dumping on unknown
devices, and scope seance session-id lookup to the caller's artifacts
and current project.

Omp-Session: 01a1b5a7-fbd3-7560-a579-bddf331c93ee
